@page "/demo/wasm-culture/invoice/net10"
@layout DemoLayout

<h1>Invoice</h1>

@* Two moments from the .NET 10 repro, recorded: what the server sent, and what the same
   component showed once WebAssembly started in an English browser. *@
<Net10Recording Sdk="10.0.102" Request="GET /?culture=de-DE, in an en-US browser"
                Repro="wasm-culture-from-server" Note="Read from the page by Playwright at each moment.">
    <table class="quickgrid moments" data-moments>
        <thead><tr><th></th><th>Culture</th><th>Total</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr><th>Server rendered</th><td>de-DE</td><td>1.234,56</td><td>Freitag, 13. November 2026</td></tr>
            <tr class="flipped"><th>WebAssembly started</th><td>en-US</td><td>1,234.56</td><td>Friday, November 13, 2026</td></tr>
            <tr><th>…with the culture passed as a parameter</th><td>en-US</td><td>1.234,56</td><td class="miss">Friday, November 13, 2026</td></tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>
    <p class="note">In a fr-FR browser the same page became <b>1 234,56</b> and <b>vendredi 13 novembre 2026</b>.</p>
</Net10Recording>
